  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Jupoklembe 11",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u Yeftha ma Jagileadi en e ng’atu ma tek ma jakero, man en e wod dhaku ma won asara: man Gilead unyolo Yeftha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhaku pa Gilead unyolo ire wote; man ka wot dhaku pare gidongo giriemo Yeftha woko, man giwacu ire kumae, Ibicamu pacu ngo i ot pa wegwa; kum in i wod dhaku mange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yeftha ulund uringo utumin mire, man ebedo i ng’om mi Tob; man dhanu ma kitgi mbe gicokri ba Yeftha man giwok woko gikugi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre yo ng’eye, nia nyithindho mir Amon gitimo ali kud Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebedo kumeno, nia ka nyithindho mir Amon gitimo ali kud Israel, e judongo mi Gilead gicidho nigamu Yeftha kud i ng’om mi Tob; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man giwacu ni Yeftha kumae, Bin ibed jawiwa, kara wakied ku nyithindho mir Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yeftha uwacu ni judongo mi Gilead kumae, Wudaga ngo, man wuriema ngo kud i ot pa vwa? man wubino i bang’a kawono nedi kinde ma wuni i cani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man judongo mi Gilead giwacu ni Yeftha kumae, Ka kumeno walokra kendo i beng’i kawono, kara wacidh wakudu, man wakiedu ku nyithindho mir Amon; man ibibedo jawiwa mi dhanu ceke mi Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yeftha wacu ni judongo mi Gilead kumae, Tek wutera thuwa kendo kara wakied ku nyithindho mir Amon, man Yehova kethogi i wang’a, abibedo jawiwu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E judongo mi Gilead giwacu ni Yeftha kumae, Yehova bibedo jamulembe i kindwa; andha wabitimo calku lembe peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeftha lund ucidho karacelo ku judongo mi Gilead, man dhanu gikethe ni jawic ku rwoth i wigi: e Yeftha yero lembe pare ceke i wang’ Yehova i Mizpa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yeftha oro jukwenda bang’ ubimo mi nyithindho mir Amon, ewacu kumae, Lembang’o ma ni kindwa wakudi, m’uketho ibino i bang’a nikiedo ku ng’om para? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo mi nyithindho mir Amon giloko lembe ni jukwenda pa Yeftha kumae, Kum Israel umayu ng’om para, kan eai kud i Misiri, ugambre Arnon cil kum Yabok, man kum Yordan: ka kumeno kawono dwok ng’om maeno kendo ma ali mbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yeftha uoro jukwenda kendo bang’ ubimo mi nyithindho mir Amon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ire kumae, Yeftha wacu kumae: Israel umayu ng’om mi Moab ungo, kadi ng’om mi nyithindho mir Amon de ngo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ka giidho kud i Misiri, man Israel ukadhu kud i yamba cil kum Nam Makwar, man gibino Kadec; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.14+NUM.20.15+NUM.20.16+NUM.20.17+NUM.20.18+NUM.20.19+NUM.20.20+NUM.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 20:14-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel ulund uoro jukwenda bang’ ubimo mir Edom, ewacu kumae, Akwei, wek akadh kud i ng’om peri; ento ubimo mir Edom uwinjo ngo. Man eoro jukwenda bang’ ubimo mi Moab de kumeca; ento eyio ngo: man Israel ubedo i Kadec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 21:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilund gicidho kud i yamba, man gidhoko ng’om mir Edom, ku ng’om mi Moab, man gibino yor i ng’et ng’om mi Moab yo nyangu, man gigonjo yo loka Arnon; ento gimondo ngo i kieu mi Moab, kum Arnon en e kieu mi Moab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 21:21-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Israel uoro jukwenda ba Sihon m’ubimo mi Juamori, m’ubimo mi Hecbon; e Israel uwacu ire kumae, Wakwei, wek wakadh kud i ng’om peri cil i kakara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Sihon ugeno Israel ungo nia ekadh kud i kieu pare; ento Sihon ucoko dhanu pare ceke karacelo, man eguro hema egonjo i Yahaz, man ekiedo kud Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, uketho Sihon, ku dhanu pare ceke i cing’ Israel, e gigoyogi: kum kumeno Israel umwonyo ng’om ceke mi Juamori, gi ju m’ubedo i ng’om maeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gimwonyo kieu ceke mi Juamori, ugambre i Arnon cil kum Yabok, man ugambre i yamba cil kum Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno kawono Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, ekabu Juamori woko ku ba piny migi i wang’ dhanu pare Israel, man maku in icam pinje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibicamu maeno ngo ma Kemoc ma mungu peri mio iri icami? Kum kumeno ng’atu ma Yehova Mungu mwa kabu piny pare woko kud i bang’e i wang’wa, maeno wabicamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.1+NUM.22.2+NUM.22.3+NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 22:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kawono in i ber ma sagu Balak ma wod Zipor, m’ubimo mi Moab ku gin moko? epiembre kud Israel, kadi ekiedo kugi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde ma Israel ubedo i Hecbon ku pacune de, man i Aroer ku pacune de, man i adhura ceke ma i ng’et Amon, rundi dak adek; wugamugi ngo nedi kendo i rundi maeca 7 ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno adubo iri ngo, ento itimo rac m’ikelo ko lwiny i kuma: Yehova, ma Japoklembe, ubed japoklembe tin i kind nyithindho mir Israel ku nyithindho mir Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ubimo mi nyithindho mir Amon uwinjo lembe pa Yeftha ngo m’eoro i bang’e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tipo pa Yehova lund ubino wi Yeftha man ekadhu kud i Gilead ku Manase, man ekadhu kud i Mizpa mi Gilead ekadhu ba nyithindho mir Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yeftha ung’olo lembang’ola ni Yehova, man ewacu kumae, Tek ibiketho nyithindho mir Amon i cinga andha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebilund bedo, nia gin ma tek uwok woko kud i dhugola mi ot para nirombo kuda, kan adwogo ku kwiocwiny ku ba nyithindho mir Amon, ebibedo pa Yehova, man abithiere malu ni lam m’awang’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yeftha kadhu lokaca ba nyithindho mir Amon nikiedo kugi; e Yehova kethogi i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man egoyogi ugambre Aroer cil m’iwok kum Minith, en e adhura pier ario, man kum Abelkeramim, ku nek ma dit apila. Kum kumeno juvoyo nyithindho mir Amon i wang’ nyithindho mir Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yeftha dwogo Mizpa ba ot pare; man, nen, nyare wok woko nirombo kude kud umbukulumbu man ku miel: man en e nyathin pare kulong’; ebedo ku wode moko ngo kadi nyare ndhu e kende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.30.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 30:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kan enene, nia eyeco kendi pare, man ewacu kumae, Akayo, nyara! ijwiga hai, man in acel m’i kind ju m’ung’abu cwinya; kum ayabu dhoga ni Yehova, man acopo dok cen ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ire kumae, Vwa, idaru yabu dhogi ni Yehova; tim ira calu gin m’uai kud i dhogi, kum Yehova culo kwor kum judegi peri piri en e kum nyithindho mir Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ni won kumae, Wek gin maeni timbre ira: wek abed akenda dwi ario, kara aai alor piny wi gudi, man aywag bedo para ma sumba, waku juwada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Cidhi. Man eore mi dwi ario: e ecidho, en ku juwagi, man eywagu bedo pare ma sumba wi gudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre ka dwi ario thum, nia edwogo ba won m’etimo i bang’e calku lembang’ola pare m’eng’olo: man nwang’u fodi eng’eyo co ngo. Man en e kura Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nia nyig Israel ucidho ku ba rundi kara gipoi kum nya Yeftha ma Jagileadi ceng’ ang’wen i rundi acel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
